{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"身份平台架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"idp-architecture","title":"身份提供者架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/idp-architecture","wordCount":1454,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"token-management","title":"令牌管理与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/token-management","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/session-management","wordCount":1529,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"身份平台架构\">身份平台架构</h1><p>本章深入身份平台的工程架构。从 IdP 的内部组件设计出发，展开令牌管理的全生命周期（签发、存储、轮转、吊销），再到会话管理的分布式实现。三篇文档覆盖了构建生产级身份平台所需的架构决策：如何设计高可用的授权服务、如何在性能与安全之间平衡令牌策略、如何实现跨服务的统一会话语义。</p>\n<p>完成本章后，读者应能设计一个支撑百万级并发的身份平台架构，理解 JWT 与 Opaque Token 的工程取舍，并掌握分布式会话的一致性与登出传播机制。</p>\n"}